+---
+id: lem-qftx-two-chart-principal-bundle-gluing
+kind: lemma
+title: Smooth principal bundle from two-chart gluing data
+status: draft
+origin: session
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+dependency_level: 0
+deps:
+  - def-smooth-principal-g-bundle
+  - def-lie-group
+dependency_roles:
