+---
+id: lem-qftx-hodge-star-decomposition-four-dimensions
+kind: lemma
+title: Hodge decomposition of two-forms in four dimensions
+status: draft
+origin: session
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+dependency_level: 0
