+[Haller, §II.4.1 and Example II.4.5](https://www.mat.univie.ac.at/~stefan/files/ASIT/ASIT.pdf)
+
+[Milnor–Stasheff, Appendix C](https://aareyanmanzoor.github.io/assets/books/characteristic-classes.pdf)
